{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest v2 COLLECTION — THE RULER  ·  #env2-coll-ruler  ·  collection WINNING-SPEC §4.2, graft C1.

  This is the instrument the ruling exists for: the second screen of the collection page, and the only
  device on it that turns N ranges into N comparable priced answers. Tap a stop and every product row
  collapses from "5–22 מ׳, מ־89.90 ₪" to one real variant at that value with its one real price; the
  lamp that cannot reach the stop DIMS to .4 and prints how far it does reach. Nothing is ever hidden.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ the no-JS contract (§3.4, binding)
  THE STATE LIVES IN RADIO INPUTS AND IN THE URL, NEVER IN A SCRIPT.
  One <input type="radio" name="env2-stop" id="env2-stop-K"> per stop, printed BEFORE
  .env2-coll-ruler__body, and every consequence is a "#env2-stop-K:checked ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body …"
  sibling rule generated by snippets/elmsnest-v2-coll-rail.liquid (emit:'css'). With scripting disabled
  the stops still narrow, every price is already in the document, the ordering links still work and every
  single-variant product still adds to cart through a native form POST.
  The JavaScript in this file is an ENHANCEMENT of eleven working lines: it copies the chosen stop into
  the URL hash so a narrowed page can be shared, and reads that hash back on load. It narrows nothing.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ four unit modes (§3.4)
    length  metres          decor        rail unit 'm'    hash #len-
    count   points of light path         rail unit 'qty'  hash #qty-
    price   the price rung  wall, spot   entry price      hash #band-
    mixed   the table of contents        all              no rail (§3.8.2)
  'auto' (the default) resolves the mode FROM THE DATA, never from a hard-coded handle list: the
  collection's own first option axes are parsed by elmsnest-v2-coll-axis, and a unit only becomes the
  rail when at least two products in the collection are measured in it. Wall has no numeric axis at all
  and spot has one product with one; both therefore fall to 'price', which is §3.4's honest answer and
  the reason this page never asks a question the catalogue cannot answer (§6.7).

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ every number is Liquid (§6.19)
  Nothing on this page is typed. The count numeral is collection.products_count; the stops are the union
  of every product's own option numbers, sorted and thinned; the rail's maximum is the largest number in
  that union; the prices are variant prices printed by elmsnest-v2-coll-rail and elmsnest-v2-price; the
  per-unit figures are the parser's own division, always '≈'-prefixed INSIDE the <bdi> (§3.5 of the
  plumbing CONTRACT — outside it the RTL algorithm moves the sign to the far edge of the line).

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ the stop key (plumbing risk 12)
  A stop key is the number with '.' replaced by '_'. "#env2-stop-6.5" reads to a CSS parser as the id
  'env2-stop-6' plus the class '5' and the narrowing silently dies. The rail keys 6.5 as 6_5 in
  data-stop, data-pick, data-short and in every generated selector, so the radio ids, the labels' `for`
  and the #len- hash here use the same transform. Decor's real axis carries 1.5, 6.5 and 9.5.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ what is NOT here (§6.1, §6.5, §6.6)
  No <select>, no funnel, no filter drawer, no grid-density control, no "מיין" button — the ordering is
  four plain ?sort_by= anchors on one hairline inside this section, above the fold (evening's one real
  findability failure was the order line at 5,900 px). best-selling and popularity are never rendered:
  one test order exists in the store's history. No badge, no strikethrough, no "-N%", no urgency.
  No product row is ever display:none.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ off the rail, carried not hidden (C9)
  A product whose first axis is a colour, a model, or an AREA is not drawn on a length rail — the net is
  sold by area and a row that says "reaches 12 m" for it is a false row (§4.5 non-negotiable 3). Those
  products are counted and named in the rail foot with an anchor to their own band (§4.3); they are
  never silently dropped.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ pagination (§3.7)
  The rows sit inside a paginate block over collection.products, by 50, so ?sort_by= survives a page
  boundary if the catalogue ever grows. At 27 products the control renders absolutely nothing, which is
  the §3.7 decision; §4.5's foot prints the sentence that says so.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign FS = '~~F~~'
  assign RS = '~~R~~'
  assign env2_s = section.settings
  assign env2_c = collection
  assign env2_count = env2_c.products_count | default: 0
  assign env2_kmax = env2_s.stops_max | default: 6
  assign env2_handle = env2_c.handle | default: ''
-%}

{%- paginate env2_c.products by 50 -%}

{%- comment -%} PASS 1 — classify every product's first axis and union its numbers, per unit (§2.6 of the plumbing CONTRACT). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_n_m = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_q = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_price = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_seen_m = '|' -%}
{%- assign env2_seen_q = '|' -%}
{%- assign env2_seen_p = '|' -%}
{%- assign env2_uni_m = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_uni_q = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_uni_p = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_pmax_c = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_types = '|' -%}
{%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
  {%- capture env2_ax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_p -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign env2_recs = env2_ax | split: RS -%}
  {%- assign env2_pm = env2_p.price_min | default: 0 -%}
  {%- if env2_p.price_max > env2_pmax_c -%}{%- assign env2_pmax_c = env2_p.price_max -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_t = env2_p.type | default: '' -%}
  {%- if env2_t != '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_tk = '|' | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
    {%- unless env2_types contains env2_tk -%}{%- assign env2_types = env2_types | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}{%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%} the price union: one stop per REAL entry price in the collection, never a typed budget {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign env2_pv = env2_pm | money_without_currency | remove: ',' -%}
  {%- assign env2_pk = '|' | append: env2_pv | append: '|' -%}
  {%- unless env2_seen_p contains env2_pk -%}
    {%- assign env2_seen_p = env2_seen_p | append: env2_pv | append: '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_z = 100000000 | plus: env2_pm -%}
    {%- assign env2_zs = env2_z | append: '' | slice: 1, 8 -%}
    {%- assign env2_uni_p = env2_uni_p | append: ',' | append: env2_zs | append: '~' | append: env2_pv -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
  {%- if env2_recs.size > 1 -%}
    {%- assign env2_meta = env2_recs[0] | split: FS -%}
    {%- if env2_meta[9] == '1' -%}
      {%- if env2_meta[3] == 'm' -%}{%- assign env2_n_m = env2_n_m | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_meta[3] == 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_n_q = env2_n_q | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- for env2_rec in env2_recs offset: 1 -%}
        {%- assign env2_r = env2_rec | split: FS -%}
        {%- if env2_r[3] != '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_n100 = env2_r[3] | times: 100 | round -%}
          {%- assign env2_z = 100000000 | plus: env2_n100 -%}
          {%- assign env2_zs = env2_z | append: '' | slice: 1, 8 -%}
          {%- assign env2_tok = ',' | append: env2_zs | append: '~' | append: env2_r[3] -%}
          {%- assign env2_gk = '|' | append: env2_r[3] | append: '|' -%}
          {%- if env2_r[4] == 'm' -%}
            {%- unless env2_seen_m contains env2_gk -%}
              {%- assign env2_seen_m = env2_seen_m | append: env2_r[3] | append: '|' -%}
              {%- assign env2_uni_m = env2_uni_m | append: env2_tok -%}
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- elsif env2_r[4] == 'qty' -%}
            {%- unless env2_seen_q contains env2_gk -%}
              {%- assign env2_seen_q = env2_seen_q | append: env2_r[3] | append: '|' -%}
              {%- assign env2_uni_q = env2_uni_q | append: env2_tok -%}
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Resolve the mode. 'auto' asks the data, not the handle: a unit becomes the rail only when at least two
  products in this collection are measured in it, which is exactly why wall and spot fall to price mode
  and never print a wattage or a Kelvin question the catalogue cannot answer (§3.4, §6.7).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_mode = env2_s.unit_mode | default: 'auto'
  if env2_mode == 'auto'
    if env2_handle == 'all'
      assign env2_mode = 'mixed'
    elsif env2_n_m >= 2
      assign env2_mode = 'length'
    elsif env2_n_q >= 2
      assign env2_mode = 'count'
    else
      assign env2_mode = 'price'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_unit = ''
  assign env2_uni = ''
  assign env2_key = 'band'
  if env2_mode == 'length'
    assign env2_unit = 'm'
    assign env2_uni = env2_uni_m
    assign env2_key = 'len'
  elsif env2_mode == 'count'
    assign env2_unit = 'qty'
    assign env2_uni = env2_uni_q
    assign env2_key = 'qty'
  elsif env2_mode == 'price'
    assign env2_uni = env2_uni_p
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Thin the union to at most stops_max members, evenly spaced by index, so every stop is a real number the
  shop actually sells. Each token was appended with a LEADING comma and the leading comma is removed here,
  because a trailing one would leave an empty member that sorts to the front and becomes a blank stop.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_uni = env2_uni | remove_first: ',' -%}
{%- assign env2_sorted = env2_uni | split: ',' | sort -%}
{%- assign env2_n = env2_sorted.size -%}
{%- assign env2_stops = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_railmax = '' -%}
{%- if env2_n > 0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_lasti = env2_n | minus: 1 -%}
  {%- assign env2_railmax = env2_sorted[env2_lasti] | split: '~' | last -%}
  {%- if env2_n <= env2_kmax -%}
    {%- for env2_t in env2_sorted -%}
      {%- assign env2_v = env2_t | split: '~' | last -%}
      {%- assign env2_stops = env2_stops | append: ',' | append: env2_v -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign env2_div = env2_kmax | minus: 1 -%}
    {%- assign env2_prev = -1 -%}
    {%- for env2_i in (0..env2_div) -%}
      {%- assign env2_idx = env2_i | times: env2_lasti | times: 1.0 | divided_by: env2_div | round -%}
      {%- if env2_idx > env2_prev -%}
        {%- assign env2_v = env2_sorted[env2_idx] | split: '~' | last -%}
        {%- assign env2_stops = env2_stops | append: ',' | append: env2_v -%}
        {%- assign env2_prev = env2_idx -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_stops = env2_stops | remove_first: ',' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_s.stops != blank -%}
  {%- assign env2_stops = env2_s.stops | replace: ' ', '' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign env2_stoplist = env2_stops | split: ',' -%}
{%- if env2_stoplist.size < 2 and env2_mode != 'mixed' -%}
  {%- assign env2_mode = 'flat' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  The rail's far end. In a price mode the stops are ENTRY prices, so the largest of them is not the end
  of the scale — the collection's own price_max is, or a bar would run past the rail. In a measured mode
  the end is the largest number in the union, which is also the last stop.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat' -%}
  {%- assign env2_railmax = env2_pmax_c | money_without_currency | remove: ',' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_railmax == blank and env2_stoplist.size > 0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_railmax = env2_stoplist | last -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_railmax == blank -%}
  {%- assign env2_railmax = 1 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_s.rail_max != blank -%}
  {%- assign env2_railmax = env2_s.rail_max -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Words. Every one of them can be overridden in the theme editor; the defaults are §4.2's copy, resolved
  from the mode and — for the h2 — from the collection the page is actually on (§4.2's five headlines).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_word = env2_s.unit_word | default: ''
  assign env2_short = env2_s.unit_short | default: ''
  if env2_word == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_word = 'מטרים'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_word = 'נקודות אור'
    endif
  endif
  if env2_short == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_short = 'מ׳'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_short = 'נק׳'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_h2 = env2_s.heading | default: ''
  if env2_h2 == ''
    if env2_handle == 'גרילנדות-ותאורה-דקורטיבית'
      assign env2_h2 = 'כמה מטרים של אור?'
    elsif env2_handle == 'תאורת-שביל-סולארית'
      assign env2_h2 = 'כמה נקודות אור לאורך הדרך?'
    elsif env2_handle == 'solar-wall-lights'
      assign env2_h2 = 'מה נכנס לתקציב?'
    elsif env2_handle == 'ספוטים-ופרוז-קטורים-סולאריים'
      assign env2_h2 = 'מה בדיוק צריך להאיר?'
    elsif env2_mode == 'mixed'
      assign env2_h2 = 'כמה אור? שלוש יחידות מידה.'
    elsif env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_h2 = 'כמה מטרים של אור?'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_h2 = 'כמה נקודות אור לאורך הדרך?'
    else
      assign env2_h2 = 'מה נכנס לתקציב?'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_stopq = env2_s.question | default: ''
  if env2_stopq == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_stopq = 'כמה מטרים צריך להאיר?'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_stopq = 'כמה נקודות אור צריך השביל?'
    elsif env2_mode == 'price'
      assign env2_stopq = 'מחיר כניסה עד הסכום שנבחר. השורה מציגה את הטווח המלא.'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_action = env2_s.action_label | default: ''
  if env2_action == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_action = 'לבחירת אורך'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_action = 'לבחירת כמות'
    else
      assign env2_action = 'לבחירת דגם'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_miss = env2_s.miss_label | default: ''
  if env2_miss == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_miss = 'האורך המרבי'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_miss = 'הכמות המרבית'
    else
      assign env2_miss = 'מחיר הכניסה'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_perword = env2_s.per_unit_word | default: ''
  if env2_perword == '' and env2_mode == 'count'
    assign env2_perword = '₪ לנקודת אור'
  endif

  assign env2_foot = env2_s.rail_foot | default: ''
  if env2_foot == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_foot = 'האורך והמחיר בכל שורה הם וריאציה קיימת. כשהמקום ארוך מהדגם — כתוב עד כמה הוא מגיע, ולא מוסתר.'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_foot = 'הכמות והמחיר בכל שורה הם וריאציה קיימת. כשצריך יותר נקודות ממה שהדגם מציע — כתוב עד כמה הוא מגיע, ולא מוסתר.'
    elsif env2_mode == 'price'
      assign env2_foot = 'כל שורה מציגה את טווח המחירים המלא של הדגם. כשמחיר הכניסה גבוה מהסכום שנבחר — כתוב מהו, ולא מוסתר.'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_showper = true
  if env2_s.show_unit_price == false
    assign env2_showper = false
  endif
  assign env2_anchor = env2_s.off_scale_anchor | default: '#env2-coll-bands'
-%}

{%- comment -%} The ordering line: four plain anchors, server-side, and never best-selling or popularity (§6.5). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_sortnow = env2_c.sort_by | default: env2_c.default_sort_by | default: 'manual'
  assign env2_sortav = '|'
  for env2_so in env2_c.sort_options
    assign env2_sortav = env2_sortav | append: env2_so.value | append: '|'
  endfor
  assign env2_manlab = env2_s.manual_label | default: ''
  if env2_manlab == ''
    if env2_mode == 'length'
      assign env2_manlab = 'לפי אורך'
    elsif env2_mode == 'count'
      assign env2_manlab = 'לפי כמות'
    else
      assign env2_manlab = 'לפי סדר הערב'
    endif
  endif
  assign env2_sortlab = env2_manlab
  if env2_sortnow == 'price-ascending'
    assign env2_sortlab = 'מחיר עולה'
  elsif env2_sortnow == 'price-descending'
    assign env2_sortlab = 'מחיר יורד'
  elsif env2_sortnow == 'title-ascending'
    assign env2_sortlab = 'א־ב'
  endif
  assign env2_curl = env2_c.url | default: ''
-%}

<section id="env2-coll-ruler" data-env2-coll-ruler data-unit-key="{{ env2_key }}" class="env2-section env2-coll env2-coll-ruler" dir="rtl" style="scroll-margin-top:90px;--env2-stars:.28"{% if env2_h2 != blank %} aria-labelledby="env2-coll-ruler-h2"{% endif %}>
  <div class="env2-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  {%- comment -%} the rail's static stylesheet, and — for a rail mode — the whole narrowing ruleset {%- endcomment -%}
  {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-rail', css: true %}
  {%- if env2_mode == 'length' or env2_mode == 'count' or env2_mode == 'price' -%}
    {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-rail', emit: 'css', stops: env2_stops, rail_max: env2_railmax, scope: '.env2-coll-ruler__body' %}
    <style id="env2-coll-ruler-stops">
      {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
        {%- assign env2_sk = env2_st | replace: '.', '_' -%}
#env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}:checked ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body .env2-coll-ruler__pill[for="env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}"]{background:var(--env2-glow);color:var(--env2-btn-ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--env2-glow),0 10px 34px -12px rgba(255,211,148,.5)}
#env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}:focus-visible ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body .env2-coll-ruler__pill[for="env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}"]{outline:2px solid var(--env2-glow);outline-offset:4px}
#env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}:checked ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body .env2-coll-ruler__tick[data-tick="{{ env2_sk }}"]{background:var(--env2-glow);block-size:14px;inset-block-start:1px}
      {%- endfor -%}
#env2-stop-all:checked ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body .env2-coll-ruler__pill[for="env2-stop-all"]{background:var(--env2-glow);color:var(--env2-btn-ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--env2-glow),0 10px 34px -12px rgba(255,211,148,.5)}
#env2-stop-all:focus-visible ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body .env2-coll-ruler__pill[for="env2-stop-all"]{outline:2px solid var(--env2-glow);outline-offset:4px}
    </style>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="env2-wrap env2-wrap--wide env2-coll-ruler__head">
    {%- if env2_s.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="env2-eyebrow env2-coll-ruler__eyebrow">{{ env2_s.eyebrow }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    <div class="env2-coll-ruler__headgrid">
      <div class="env2-coll-ruler__numblock" data-lamp>
        <p class="env2-coll-ruler__num" aria-hidden="true"><bdi>{{ env2_count }}</bdi></p>
        <p class="env2-coll-ruler__numcap">
          {%- if env2_mode == 'mixed' -%}
            <bdi>{{ env2_count }}</bdi> דגמים בקטלוג · שלוש יחידות מידה
          {%- elsif env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat' -%}
            <bdi>{{ env2_count }}</bdi> דגמים בקולקציה · הסרגל כאן הוא מחיר הכניסה
          {%- else -%}
            <bdi>{{ env2_count }}</bdi> דגמים בקולקציה · <bdi>{% if env2_unit == 'm' %}{{ env2_n_m }}{% else %}{{ env2_n_q }}{% endif %}</bdi> מהם נמדדים ב{{ env2_word }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="env2-coll-ruler__ask">
        <h2 class="env2-h env2-coll-ruler__h2" id="env2-coll-ruler-h2">{{ env2_h2 }}</h2>
        {%- if env2_s.deck != blank -%}<p class="env2-lead env2-coll-ruler__deck">{{ env2_s.deck }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The radios. They are SIBLINGS of .env2-coll-ruler__body and come before it, because the generated
    ruleset is "#env2-stop-K:checked ~ .env2-coll-ruler__body …" and the general sibling combinator
    needs one parent. Visually hidden, never display:none — they must stay focusable (§3.4 no-JS).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if env2_mode == 'length' or env2_mode == 'count' or env2_mode == 'price' -%}
    <input type="radio" name="env2-stop" id="env2-stop-all" class="env2-coll-ruler__sr" checked>
    {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
      {%- assign env2_sk = env2_st | replace: '.', '_' -%}
      <input type="radio" name="env2-stop" id="env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}" class="env2-coll-ruler__sr">
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="env2-wrap env2-wrap--wide env2-coll-ruler__body">

    {%- comment -%} the stops, then the order line, on the two hairlines of §3.4's sketch {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if env2_mode == 'length' or env2_mode == 'count' or env2_mode == 'price' -%}
      <div class="env2-coll-ruler__stops" role="group"{% if env2_stopq != blank %} aria-label="{{ env2_stopq | escape }}"{% endif %}>
        {%- if env2_stopq != blank -%}<p class="env2-coll-ruler__stopq">{{ env2_stopq }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        <div class="env2-coll-ruler__pills">
          <label class="env2-coll-ruler__pill" for="env2-stop-all"><span class="env2-coll-ruler__pilltxt">הכול</span></label>
          {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
            {%- assign env2_sk = env2_st | replace: '.', '_' -%}
            <label class="env2-coll-ruler__pill" for="env2-stop-{{ env2_sk }}"><span class="env2-coll-ruler__pilltxt">
              {%- if env2_mode == 'price' -%}עד <bdi>{{ env2_st }}</bdi> ₪{%- else -%}<bdi>{{ env2_st }}</bdi> {{ env2_short }}{%- endif -%}
            </span></label>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <p class="env2-coll-ruler__sort">
      <span class="env2-kicker env2-coll-ruler__sortlab">סדר:</span>
      {%- if env2_sortav == '|' or env2_sortav contains '|manual|' -%}
        <a href="{{ env2_curl }}?sort_by=manual" class="env2-coll-ruler__sortlink{% if env2_sortnow == 'manual' %} is-current{% endif %}"{% if env2_sortnow == 'manual' %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>{{ env2_manlab }}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_sortav == '|' or env2_sortav contains '|price-ascending|' -%}
        <a href="{{ env2_curl }}?sort_by=price-ascending" class="env2-coll-ruler__sortlink{% if env2_sortnow == 'price-ascending' %} is-current{% endif %}"{% if env2_sortnow == 'price-ascending' %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>מחיר עולה</a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_sortav == '|' or env2_sortav contains '|price-descending|' -%}
        <a href="{{ env2_curl }}?sort_by=price-descending" class="env2-coll-ruler__sortlink{% if env2_sortnow == 'price-descending' %} is-current{% endif %}"{% if env2_sortnow == 'price-descending' %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>מחיר יורד</a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_sortav == '|' or env2_sortav contains '|title-ascending|' -%}
        <a href="{{ env2_curl }}?sort_by=title-ascending" class="env2-coll-ruler__sortlink{% if env2_sortnow == 'title-ascending' %} is-current{% endif %}"{% if env2_sortnow == 'title-ascending' %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>א־ב</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
    {%- if env2_sortnow != 'manual' and env2_sortnow != blank and env2_s.sort_note != blank -%}
      <p class="env2-coll-ruler__sortnote">ממוין לפי {{ env2_sortlab }} — {{ env2_s.sort_note }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if env2_mode == 'mixed' -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        §3.8.2 — on the catalogue the ruler becomes the table of contents, because three units cannot
        share one column and pretending they can is the lie §3.4 refuses. Three unit numerals that are
        also jump links, then one entry per place with its count, its span and its first three lamps.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign env2_n_other = env2_count | minus: env2_n_m | minus: env2_n_q -%}
      <ul class="env2-coll-ruler__units">
        <li class="env2-coll-ruler__unit">
          <a href="{{ env2_anchor }}"><span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitn"><bdi>{{ env2_n_other }}</bdi></span>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitt">מנורה אחת, מקום אחד</span>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitk">הסרגל: מחיר</span></a>
        </li>
        <li class="env2-coll-ruler__unit">
          <a href="{{ env2_anchor }}"><span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitn"><bdi>{{ env2_n_q }}</bdi></span>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitt">שורה של נקודות</span>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitk">הסרגל: יחידות</span></a>
        </li>
        <li class="env2-coll-ruler__unit">
          <a href="{{ env2_anchor }}"><span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitn"><bdi>{{ env2_n_m }}</bdi></span>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitt">קו רצוף של אור</span>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__unitk">הסרגל: מטרים</span></a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      {%- assign env2_typelist = env2_types | remove_first: '|' | split: '|' -%}
      <ol class="env2-coll-ruler__places">
        {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- assign env2_bt = block.settings.product_type | default: '' -%}
            {%- assign env2_pn = 0 -%}
            {%- assign env2_lo = 0 -%}
            {%- assign env2_hi = 0 -%}
            {%- assign env2_names = '' -%}
            {%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
              {%- if env2_p.type == env2_bt -%}
                {%- assign env2_pn = env2_pn | plus: 1 -%}
                {%- if env2_lo == 0 or env2_p.price_min < env2_lo -%}{%- assign env2_lo = env2_p.price_min -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_p.price_max > env2_hi -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_p.price_max -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_pn <= 3 -%}{%- assign env2_names = env2_names | append: '~' | append: env2_p.title -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
            {%- if env2_pn > 0 -%}
              <li class="env2-coll-ruler__place" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <a class="env2-coll-ruler__placelink" href="{{ block.settings.anchor | default: env2_anchor }}">
                  <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placehead">
                    <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placelab">{{ block.settings.label | default: env2_bt }}</span>
                    {%- if block.settings.question != blank -%}<span class="env2-coll-ruler__placeq">{{ block.settings.question }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placefacts">
                    <bdi>{{ env2_pn }}</bdi> מנורות · <bdi>{{ env2_lo | money_without_currency }}–{{ env2_hi | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪
                  </span>
                  <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placenames">{{ env2_names | remove_first: '~' | split: '~' | join: ' · ' }}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for env2_bt in env2_typelist -%}
            {%- assign env2_pn = 0 -%}
            {%- assign env2_lo = 0 -%}
            {%- assign env2_hi = 0 -%}
            {%- assign env2_names = '' -%}
            {%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
              {%- if env2_p.type == env2_bt -%}
                {%- assign env2_pn = env2_pn | plus: 1 -%}
                {%- if env2_lo == 0 or env2_p.price_min < env2_lo -%}{%- assign env2_lo = env2_p.price_min -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_p.price_max > env2_hi -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_p.price_max -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_pn <= 3 -%}{%- assign env2_names = env2_names | append: '~' | append: env2_p.title -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
            {%- if env2_pn > 0 -%}
              <li class="env2-coll-ruler__place">
                <a class="env2-coll-ruler__placelink" href="{{ env2_anchor }}">
                  <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placehead">
                    <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placelab">{{ env2_bt }}</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placefacts">
                    <bdi>{{ env2_pn }}</bdi> מנורות · <bdi>{{ env2_lo | money_without_currency }}–{{ env2_hi | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪
                  </span>
                  <span class="env2-coll-ruler__placenames">{{ env2_names | remove_first: '~' | split: '~' | join: ' · ' }}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </ol>

    {%- else -%}

      {%- comment -%} the master rail: one hairline, the ticks of the stops, and the cursor the generated ruleset moves {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if env2_mode != 'flat' -%}
        <div class="env2-coll-ruler__master" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__masterpad"></span>
          <div class="env2-coll-ruler__track">
            <span class="env2-coll-rail__line"></span>
            <span class="env2-coll-rail__cursor env2-coll-ruler__cursor"></span>
            {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign env2_sk = env2_st | replace: '.', '_'
                assign env2_tp = env2_st | times: 100.0 | divided_by: env2_railmax | round: 2
                if env2_tp > 100
                  assign env2_tp = 100
                endif
              -%}
              <span class="env2-coll-ruler__tick" data-tick="{{ env2_sk }}" style="--env2-tick-p:{{ env2_tp }}%"></span>
            {%- endfor -%}
            <span class="env2-coll-ruler__end env2-coll-ruler__end--a"><bdi>0</bdi>{% if env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat' %} ₪{% endif %}</span>
            <span class="env2-coll-ruler__end env2-coll-ruler__end--b"><bdi>{{ env2_railmax }}</bdi> {% if env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat' %}₪{% else %}{{ env2_short }}{% endif %}</span>
          </div>
          <span class="env2-coll-ruler__masterpad"></span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} the rows. One per product ON the rail; the ones that are not are counted in the foot (C9). {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign env2_off = 0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_on = 0 -%}
      <div class="env2-coll-ruler__rows">
        {%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
          {%- capture env2_ax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_p, per_unit_word: env2_perword -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_recs = env2_ax | split: RS -%}
          {%- assign env2_meta = '' | split: '~' -%}
          {%- if env2_recs.size > 1 -%}{%- assign env2_meta = env2_recs[0] | split: FS -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign env2_onrail = false
            if env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat'
              assign env2_onrail = true
            elsif env2_recs.size > 1 and env2_meta[9] == '1' and env2_meta[3] == env2_unit
              assign env2_onrail = true
            endif
          -%}
          {%- if env2_onrail == false -%}
            {%- assign env2_off = env2_off | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign env2_on = env2_on | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign env2_vcount = env2_meta[18] | default: ''
              assign env2_axname = env2_meta[2] | default: ''
              assign env2_optword = 'אפשרויות'
            -%}
            {%- capture env2_shortlist -%}
              {%- if env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat' -%}
                {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
                  {%- assign env2_sc = env2_st | times: 100 | round -%}
                  {%- if env2_p.price_min > env2_sc -%}{{ env2_st | replace: '.', '_' }} {% endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-rail', product: env2_p, stops: env2_stops, unit: env2_unit, emit: 'short' -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endcapture -%}
            {%- assign env2_shortlist = env2_shortlist | strip -%}
            <div class="env2-coll-ruler__row"{% if env2_shortlist != '' %} data-short="{{ env2_shortlist | escape }}"{% endif %}>
              <div class="env2-coll-ruler__rowhead">
                <p class="env2-coll-ruler__title"><a href="{{ env2_p.url }}">{{ env2_p.title }}</a></p>
                {%- comment -%}
                  The axis caption is printed only when the axis really is a choice: a product whose
                  single option is Shopify's untranslated default (name Title, value Default Title) or
                  which has one value has nothing to say here, and "Title · 1 אפשרויות" would be both an
                  English UI string and bad Hebrew. Guarded, not typed around.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if env2_axname != '' and env2_axname != 'Title' and env2_vcount != '' and env2_vcount != '1' -%}
                  <p class="env2-coll-ruler__axis">{{ env2_axname }} · <bdi>{{ env2_vcount }}</bdi> {{ env2_optword }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              <div class="env2-coll-ruler__rail">
                {%- if env2_mode == 'price' or env2_mode == 'flat' -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign env2_rmc = env2_railmax | times: 100.0
                    if env2_rmc <= 0
                      assign env2_rmc = 1.0
                    endif
                    assign env2_p1 = env2_p.price_min | times: 100.0 | divided_by: env2_rmc | round: 2
                    assign env2_p2 = env2_p.price_max | times: 100.0 | divided_by: env2_rmc | round: 2
                    if env2_p1 > 100
                      assign env2_p1 = 100
                    endif
                    if env2_p2 > 100
                      assign env2_p2 = 100
                    endif
                    assign env2_pw = env2_p2 | minus: env2_p1
                    if env2_pw < 0
                      assign env2_pw = 0
                    endif
                    assign env2_pick = ''
                    for env2_st in env2_stoplist
                      assign env2_sc = env2_st | times: 100 | round
                      assign env2_sk = env2_st | replace: '.', '_'
                      if env2_p.price_min <= env2_sc
                        assign env2_pick = env2_pick | append: ' ' | append: env2_sk
                      endif
                    endfor
                    assign env2_pick = env2_pick | append: ' all' | strip
                  -%}
                  <div class="env2-coll-rail" data-unit="price" data-state="on"{% if env2_shortlist != '' %} data-short="{{ env2_shortlist | escape }}"{% endif %}>
                    <span class="env2-coll-rail__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="env2-coll-ruler__bar" style="--env2-bar-a:{{ env2_p1 }}%;--env2-bar-w:{{ env2_pw }}%" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="env2-coll-rail__dot" data-n="{{ env2_p.price_min | money_without_currency }}" data-pick="{{ env2_pick }}" style="--env2-rail-p:{{ env2_p1 }}%" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="env2-coll-rail__v env2-coll-rail__v--all" data-stop="all" data-state="span">
                      <span class="env2-coll-rail__price">{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-price', product: env2_p -%}</span>
                    </span>
                    {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
                      {%- assign env2_sk = env2_st | replace: '.', '_' -%}
                      {%- assign env2_sc = env2_st | times: 100 | round -%}
                      {%- if env2_p.price_min <= env2_sc -%}
                        <span class="env2-coll-rail__v" data-stop="{{ env2_sk }}" data-state="at">
                          <span class="env2-coll-rail__price">{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-price', product: env2_p -%}</span>
                        </span>
                      {%- else -%}
                        <span class="env2-coll-rail__v" data-stop="{{ env2_sk }}" data-state="beyond">
                          <span class="env2-coll-rail__miss">{{ env2_miss }}: <bdi>{{ env2_p.price_min | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪</span>
                          <span class="env2-coll-rail__price env2-coll-rail__price--miss">{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-price', product: env2_p -%}</span>
                        </span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                {%- else -%}
                  {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-rail', product: env2_p, stops: env2_stops, unit: env2_unit, rail_max: env2_railmax, miss_label: env2_miss, per_unit_word: env2_perword, show_per: env2_showper %}
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              <div class="env2-coll-ruler__act">
                {% render 'elmsnest-v2-buy', product: env2_p, label: env2_action, small: true %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      <div class="env2-coll-ruler__foot">
        {%- if env2_foot != blank -%}<p class="env2-coll-ruler__footnote">{{ env2_foot }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_off > 0 -%}
          <p class="env2-coll-ruler__offnote">
            <a class="env2-link" href="{{ env2_anchor }}"><bdi>{{ env2_off }}</bdi> מוצרים בקולקציה אינם נמדדים ביחידה הזאת <span aria-hidden="true">←</span></a>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

    {%- endif -%}

    {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-paginate', paginate: paginate, collection: env2_c %}
  </div>
</section>

{%- endpaginate -%}

{% stylesheet %}
/* ---------- ElmsNest v2 collection — the ruler (§4.2). Every selector is prefixed .env2-coll-ruler.
   The per-stop :checked ruleset is NOT here: it is generated per instance by
   snippets/elmsnest-v2-coll-rail.liquid (emit:'css') and by the inline style element above, because
   a section stylesheet block is static and may hold no Liquid. ---------- */
.env2-coll-ruler{padding-block:120px 96px}
.env2-coll-ruler__head,.env2-coll-ruler__body{position:relative;z-index:1}

/* the head: numeral at the start edge, the place's question beside it (§4.2 desktop) */
.env2-coll-ruler__eyebrow{margin-block-end:26px}
.env2-coll-ruler__headgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,auto) minmax(0,1fr);
  gap:clamp(24px,4vw,72px);align-items:end}
.env2-coll-ruler__num{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:900;
  font-size:clamp(88px,10vw,150px);line-height:.86;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  color:rgba(255,211,148,calc(.92*var(--lit,1)));-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--env2-hair-num);
  transition:color 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.env2-coll-ruler__numcap{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-ink-2);
  max-inline-size:26ch;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-ruler__h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.9vw,72px);line-height:.98}
.env2-coll-ruler__deck{margin-block-start:18px;max-inline-size:42ch}

/* the stops. 48px pills, 999px radius — with the cursor knob the only round things on this page. */
.env2-coll-ruler__sr{position:absolute;inline-size:1px;block-size:1px;margin:0;padding:0;border:0;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;clip-path:inset(50%)}
.env2-coll-ruler__stops{margin-block-start:clamp(40px,5vw,72px)}
.env2-coll-ruler__stopq{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-coll-ruler__pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.env2-coll-ruler__pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  min-block-size:48px;padding-inline:22px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--env2-hair-btn);background:transparent;color:var(--env2-ink);
  font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  transition:box-shadow .3s,background-color .3s,color .3s,transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.env2-coll-ruler__pill:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ruler__pilltxt{display:block}

/* the order line — four plain anchors on one hairline, inside this section and above the fold (§4.2 n-n 4) */
.env2-coll-ruler__sort{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 20px;margin:26px 0 0;
  padding-block:16px;border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair);
  border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-ruler__sortlab{flex:none;font-size:11.5px}
.env2-coll-ruler__sortlink{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-block-size:44px;padding-inline:2px;
  font-size:15px;color:var(--env2-ink-2);border-block-end:1px solid transparent;transition:color .3s,border-color .3s}
.env2-coll-ruler__sortlink:hover,.env2-coll-ruler__sortlink:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ruler__sortlink.is-current{color:var(--env2-glow);border-block-end-color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ruler__sortnote{margin:14px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}

/* the master rail. Same grid as a row, so the cursor stands over the column of dots. */
.env2-coll-ruler__master{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,270px) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,150px);
  gap:clamp(16px,2vw,32px);align-items:center;margin-block-start:clamp(36px,4vw,60px);
  padding-block-end:34px}
.env2-coll-ruler__track{position:relative;block-size:16px;min-inline-size:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__cursor{inset-block-start:1px}
.env2-coll-ruler__tick{position:absolute;inset-block-start:4px;inset-inline-start:var(--env2-tick-p,0);
  margin-inline-start:-1px;inline-size:1px;block-size:9px;background:var(--env2-hair-num);display:block;
  transition:background-color .3s,block-size .25s}
.env2-coll-ruler__end{position:absolute;inset-block-start:22px;font-family:var(--env2-serif);
  font-weight:500;font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  color:var(--env2-mute);white-space:nowrap}
.env2-coll-ruler__end--a{inset-inline-start:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__end--b{inset-inline-end:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__masterpad{display:block}

/* one row per product. It never disappears and it is never four equal cells. */
.env2-coll-ruler__rows{border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-ruler__row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,270px) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,150px);
  gap:clamp(16px,2vw,32px);align-items:center;min-block-size:96px;padding-block:18px;
  border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair);transition:opacity .28s}
.env2-coll-ruler__rowhead{min-inline-size:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__title{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,19px);line-height:1.35;color:var(--env2-ink);unicode-bidi:isolate;
  text-wrap:balance}
.env2-coll-ruler__title a{transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-ruler__title a:hover,.env2-coll-ruler__title a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ruler__axis{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--env2-ink-2);
  unicode-bidi:isolate}
/* The dot rail is positioned in PERCENT of its own column, so it can never be wider than the row and
   never needs a scroller — and a scroller here would CLIP the dot that sits on the rail's far end
   (measured: the rope's 32 מ׳ dot came out as a half circle under overflow-x:auto). The document's own
   no-horizontal-scroll guarantee (§6.13) is .env2-section{overflow-x:clip} plus the ground snippet;
   both viewports measure horizontal-overflow=false at 1440, 390 and 360. */
.env2-coll-ruler__rail{min-inline-size:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__rail .env2-coll-rail__v{justify-content:flex-end}
.env2-coll-ruler__act{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end}
.env2-coll-ruler__act .env2-btn{min-block-size:44px;color:var(--env2-btn-ink)}
.env2-coll-ruler__act .env2-btn--ghost{color:var(--env2-ink)}

/* price mode: the rung is a solid bar to the entry price and a hairline on to the top of the range */
.env2-coll-ruler__bar{position:absolute;inset-block-start:8px;inset-inline-start:var(--env2-bar-a,0);
  inline-size:var(--env2-bar-w,0);block-size:1px;background:var(--env2-hair-num);display:block}

/* the foot: the honest sentence, and the products this unit cannot measure — carried, never hidden (C9) */
.env2-coll-ruler__foot{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:12px 40px;
  margin-block-start:28px}
.env2-coll-ruler__footnote{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-ink-2);
  max-inline-size:64ch}
.env2-coll-ruler__offnote{margin:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__offnote .env2-link{min-block-size:44px}

/* the catalogue variant (§3.8.2): three unit numerals, then the four places */
.env2-coll-ruler__units{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:clamp(20px,3vw,52px);margin:clamp(36px,4vw,60px) 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.env2-coll-ruler__unit{padding-block:0}
.env2-coll-ruler__unit a{display:block;transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-ruler__unit a:hover,.env2-coll-ruler__unit a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ruler__unitn{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:900;
  font-size:clamp(56px,6.6vw,96px);line-height:.9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--env2-gold)}
.env2-coll-ruler__unitt{display:block;margin-block-start:10px;font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,19px);
  color:var(--env2-ink)}
.env2-coll-ruler__unitk{display:block;margin-block-start:6px;font-size:14px;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-coll-ruler__places{margin:clamp(36px,4vw,60px) 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.env2-coll-ruler__place{border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-ruler__placelink{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,.6fr) minmax(0,1fr);
  gap:clamp(16px,2vw,40px);align-items:baseline;padding-block:22px;transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-ruler__placelink:hover,.env2-coll-ruler__placelink:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ruler__placelab{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,32px);line-height:1.05;color:inherit}
.env2-coll-ruler__placeq{display:block;margin-block-start:8px;font-size:14px;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-coll-ruler__placefacts{font-size:15px;color:var(--env2-ink-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  white-space:nowrap}
.env2-coll-ruler__placenames{font-size:14px;color:var(--env2-mute);unicode-bidi:isolate}

@media (max-width:900px){
  .env2-coll-ruler{padding-block:72px 56px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__headgrid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}
  .env2-coll-ruler__num{font-size:88px;line-height:.9}
  .env2-coll-ruler__numcap{max-inline-size:none}
  .env2-coll-ruler__h2{font-size:34px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__deck{margin-block-start:14px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__stops{margin-block-start:36px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__pills{gap:8px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__pill{min-block-size:48px;padding-inline:18px;font-size:14px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__sort{gap:6px 16px;margin-block-start:22px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__sortlink{font-size:14px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__master{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0;padding-block-end:30px;
    margin-block-start:30px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__masterpad{display:none}
  .env2-coll-ruler__end{font-size:13px;inset-block-start:20px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__rail .env2-coll-rail__v{justify-content:flex-start}
  .env2-coll-ruler__row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:2px;min-block-size:0;padding-block:20px;
    align-items:stretch}
  .env2-coll-ruler__rail{margin-block-start:2px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__act{justify-content:flex-end;margin-block-start:12px}
  /* the row head is the product link's real tap area on a phone: the house hit expander (core does
     the same for .env2-link under 900px) over a head that is floored at the 44px target (§6.13).
     A product whose axis caption is suppressed leaves a 22px title alone, which would miss it. */
  .env2-coll-ruler__rowhead{position:relative;min-block-size:44px;display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
  .env2-coll-ruler__title a::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-6px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__foot{gap:14px;margin-block-start:24px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__units{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0}
  .env2-coll-ruler__unit{padding-block:20px;border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
  .env2-coll-ruler__unitn{font-size:56px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__placelink{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;padding-block:20px}
  .env2-coll-ruler__placefacts{white-space:normal}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .env2-coll-ruler__num{transition:none}
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
/* elmsnest-v2-coll-ruler — the ENHANCEMENT, and nothing else (collection WINNING-SPEC §3.4).
   The narrowing itself is radio inputs plus generated ":checked ~" CSS and works with this file
   deleted, with scripting disabled and with reduced motion on. All this does is:
     1. read #len-10 / #qty-4 / #band-149_90 out of the URL on load and check that stop, so a narrowed
        page can be shared;
     2. write the chosen stop back into the hash on change, with replaceState so no history entry and
        no scroll jump is created (a :target mechanism would jump; that is why this page uses radios).
   history.replaceState throws on some file:// and sandboxed contexts, so it is guarded — a failure
   must never cost the visitor the narrowing, which is not ours to break. Ends with the CONTRACT's
   env2.observe fallback line so the count numeral lights (and lights anyway without JS). */
(function () {
  function init(el) {
    if (el.__env2CollRuler) return;
    el.__env2CollRuler = true;
    var key = el.getAttribute('data-unit-key') || 'len';
    var pick = function (hash) {
      if (!hash) return;
      var k = hash.replace(/^#(len|qty|band)-/, '');
      if (k === hash || !k) return;
      if (!/^[A-Za-z0-9_]+$/.test(k)) return;
      var input = el.querySelector('#env2-stop-' + k);
      if (input && input.name === 'env2-stop') input.checked = true;
    };
    pick(window.location.hash);
    el.addEventListener('change', function (e) {
      var t = e.target;
      if (!t || t.name !== 'env2-stop' || !t.id) return;
      var v = t.id.replace('env2-stop-', '');
      try {
        window.history.replaceState(null, '',
          v === 'all' ? window.location.pathname + window.location.search : '#' + key + '-' + v);
      } catch (err) { /* file:// and sandboxed documents refuse replaceState; the radio still narrowed */ }
    });
    window.env2 ? env2.observe(el) : el.querySelectorAll('[data-lamp]').forEach(function (l) { l.classList.add('lit'); });
  }
  function boot(root) {
    var scope = (root && root.querySelectorAll) ? root : document;
    scope.querySelectorAll('[data-env2-coll-ruler]').forEach(init);
    if (scope !== document && scope.matches && scope.matches('[data-env2-coll-ruler]')) init(scope);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () { boot(document); });
  } else {
    boot(document);
  }
  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) { boot(e.target || document); });
})();
{% endjavascript %}

